"label": "Take one half",
"explanation": "Because \\(0.5\\) is one half, multiplying by \\(0.5\\) takes half of the other factor. The number \\(1.2\\) is \\(12\\) tenths, and half of \\(12\\) tenths is \\(6\\) tenths. Therefore, \\(1.2\\times0.5=0.6\\).",
