"explanation": "Plan A: \\(30+0.1\\times500=80\\) yuan; Plan B: \\(0.15\\times500=75\\) yuan. Plan B costs less. (The two plans cost the same when \\(30+0.1t=0.15t\\), giving \\(t=600\\). Plan B costs less for fewer than 600 minutes of calls.)",
