"question": "Given \\(a\\parallel b\\), line \\(c\\) intersects \\(a\\) and \\(b\\). Angles \\(\\angle 1\\) and \\(\\angle 2\\) are same-side interior angles, and \\(\\angle 1\\) is 3 times \\(\\angle 2\\). What is the measure of \\(\\angle 1\\) in degrees?",
