"explanation": "The powers are small enough to evaluate each factor directly. The four factors are \\(3\\), \\(5\\), \\(17\\), and \\(257\\), so multiplying in order gives\n\\[\n\\begin{aligned}\n3\\cdot5\\cdot17\\cdot257\n&=15\\cdot17\\cdot257\\\\\n&=255\\cdot257\\\\\n&=65535.\n\\end{aligned}\n\\]\nThus the value is \\(65535\\).",
