"explanation": "\\((n+3)^2-n^2=(n+3+n)(n+3-n)=3(2n+3)\\), which must be a multiple of \\(3\\). Since \\(2n+3\\) is odd and is not necessarily a multiple of \\(3\\), the expression is not necessarily divisible by \\(2\\), \\(6\\), or \\(9\\).",
