"responseType": "numeric",
"question": "What are the sum and product, respectively, of the two roots of \\(x²-5x+6=0\\)? (Answer in order, separated by a comma.)",
"questionType": "text",
"choices": {},
"choiceOrder": [],
"choicesType": "text",
"answer": "5，6",
"acceptedResponses": [
"5，6"
],
"rejectedAnswers": [],
"unorderedAnswers": false,
"solution": "\\(a=1\\), \\(b=-5\\), and \\(c=6\\). The sum of the two roots is \\(-b/a=5\\), and their product is \\(c/a=6\\). (This can also be verified by directly finding the roots \\(2\\) and \\(3\\).)",
