"responseType": "choice",
"question": "\\(OA\\) is a radius of circle \\(O\\), \\(OA=5\\), and point \\(B\\) satisfies \\(AB=12\\) and \\(OB=13\\). The relative position of line \\(AB\\) and circle \\(O\\) is",
