"responseType": "choice",
"question": "\\(DE\\parallel BC\\), and \\(D\\) and \\(E\\) lie on \\(AB\\) and \\(AC\\), respectively. Which pair of similar triangles is shown in the diagram? (In \\(\\triangle ABC\\), \\(D\\) lies on \\(AB\\) and \\(E\\) lies on \\(AC\\); corresponding vertices are listed in order.)\n\n[Figure 1](figures/cnm_273_q1_question_en.svg)",
