"label": "Compare the required depths",
"explanation": "The required depth is \\(5\\times\\sin\\theta\\). At \\(45^\\circ\\), it is approximately \\(3.5\\text{ m}\\le4\\text{ m}\\). At \\(60^\\circ\\), it is approximately 4.33 m; at \\(75^\\circ\\), approximately 4.83 m; and at \\(90^\\circ\\), 5 m. All of these exceed 4 m.",
