"explanation": "The probability of red on the first draw is \\(5/10\\). Given that the first ball is red, 9 balls remain, including all 5 blue balls, so the conditional probability of blue on the second draw is \\(5/9\\). Multiplying gives \\((5/10)(5/9)=5/18\\).",
